WEBVTT

00:10:28.791 --> 00:10:31.043
For the children
not to go through this again.

00:10:31.794 --> 00:10:34.505
What they want is to break
the cycle of poverty.

00:10:34.963 --> 00:10:36.840
The next step that I'm taking

00:10:36.882 --> 00:10:39.677
is to go to the northern part
of my country, Benin.

00:10:41.303 --> 00:10:44.181
The girls in Benin, at eight years old,

00:10:44.181 --> 00:10:47.601
are sent to the man
that's going to marry them home,

00:10:47.601 --> 00:10:50.020
they become maids,

00:10:50.062 --> 00:10:51.689
until they have --

00:10:51.689 --> 00:10:53.273
And I want to break that cycle.

00:10:53.273 --> 00:10:54.608
I've been working hard.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:56.985
I’ve been asking for help
with this for so long.

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:01.990
We're going to start there
with local organizations.